Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Ep 6
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Opening
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Shop name,0000,0000,0000,,(Baumkuchen is a cake that is usually ciruclar with a whole in the middle. The cake often has rings on it much like a tree. It gets it�s name from the German word for Tree (baum) and the German word for cake (kuchen.)
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Shop name,0000,0000,0000,,{TL note on the cake thing?}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Next episode,0000,0000,0000,,A Kind Person
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.58,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Children, you didn’t forget anything, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.70,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You brought your lunches, drinking water and treats with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:10.99,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.71,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, Kobato-chan, you two didn’t forget anything either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:15.58,KM,Fujimoto and Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:18.57,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’re not bringing anything on the field trip? {Keeper: orig line "Are you going on the field trip with nothing?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. I’ll go get my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.97,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:33.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:10.28,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it’s just you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.57,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:13.27,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:16.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone’s going on a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:20.55,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, so that’s why you seemed so happy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:23.12,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! It seems like it’ll be really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why you should come as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.62,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.69,KM,Iryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? You have to answer it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:42.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello! Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:44.56,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato…?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I messed up! It's Yomogi Preschool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.08,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:51.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m helping out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.79,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,You’re lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:03:00.24,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Where’s Sayaka? I’d like to speak with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:03.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, she‘s just about to go on a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:05.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have some sort of business with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:09.46,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I do. Could you give her a message for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:15.00,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,She needs to close down the\Nschool and leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:19.25,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Her loan will not be extended any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you the debt collector?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:30.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Earlier, they came to the\Npreschool and bullied everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.33,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,They did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:37.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:39.67,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:44.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Because you didn’t do it, so I thought you might get upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:51.03,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,What a funny girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:52.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:04:00.24,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Regrettably, your help there is no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.94,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to crush the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:12.33,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:17.28,KM,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Please pass the message on to Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.33,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, who are…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:26.13,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Crush the preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:30.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if that person was an\Nacquaintance of Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m passing on the field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:39.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:43.26,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be taking a nap until you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:54.15,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you’re late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:56.19,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How long were you going to make us wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:59.11,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, we're already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:05.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was just wondering if the debt collector is an acquaintance of Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:06.38,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:10.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Just now, a man called.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He said he was going to crush the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:15.68,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:19.97,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t tell Sayaka-sensei about the phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:23.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But he seemed like such a scary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:29.02,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay, just stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:39.57,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, Fujimoto-kun, we’re leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:42.23,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry! We’re coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:06:01.31,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Like always, the entrance was left in a strange spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Shop name,0000,0000,0000,,Bear’s Baumkuchen Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:31.66,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.36,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:37.45,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.45,0:06:40.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have to insert yourself in the shop’s name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.59,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,It can’t be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:46.73,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,On top of having to work here, the shop was also named after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.85,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That character decided {\i1}that{\i0} too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:52.77,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t say “that character.”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:56.73,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,You’re still not disgusted with what you turned into?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:59.53,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There’s nothing to be disgusted with! I’m fine the way I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:03.67,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you have to rage like that?! And yet you complain, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:10.24,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,If they heard that kind of talk from you, you wouldn't even be a stuffed animal next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.08,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,You’d be the size of a finger puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:18.56,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Now that that’s over, what did you come here for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.34,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.75,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? Get over your pride. {Keeper: I don’t quite like the original, nor my own suggestion really… orig line "What is it? Don’t act so important."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:26.59,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There’s something I’d like you to look into for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:33.88,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Sit. I guess I’ll listen to you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.67,0:07:40.01,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Ooooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.90,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.71,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:47.59,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:49.30,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,A lake, a huge lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:51.49,KP,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to crush the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:56.46,KT,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who the person on the phone was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:59.25,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:04.67,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun, Marina-chan,\Nwe’re going to eat lunch soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.40,KM,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:15.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Bump appeared on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:18.47,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you’ve been doing painful things since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.79,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You‘re pretty spaced out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:23.33,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Is something bothering you, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:28.69,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t she always spaced out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:30.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not always!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:35.83,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t give Sayaka-sensei extra things to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:39.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:50.05,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,So, you want information about the people involved with Yomogi Preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:51.44,KM,Iyorogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:58.76,KM,Ioyrogi,0000,0000,0000,,What now? Has that pitiful form left your data gathering abilities rusty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:03.42,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,My form aside, yours is a million times more pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:06.94,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,But anyway, to hear you ask something like that… {Keeper: orig line "But, to hear those words from you…"}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:11.15,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Long ago, the only thing you’d say is “research it!”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:14.70,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,If I didn’t listen to you, along came the firebreathing and the fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:19.98,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then to fulfill your expectations, I’ll give you an extra large helping! {Keeper: orig line "Then to go along with your wishes, I’ll give you an extra large one."}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:22.01,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:24.50,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, they’re finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:28.48,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, haven’t you become a little too used to this job?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:37.39,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If your former subordinates saw the way you are now, they'd probably cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.99,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t want to hear that from a stuffed animal like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:43.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.73,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take on that job you talked about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:49.12,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,It has something to do with that young lady, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:56.34,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,This time, I’ll do it as a favor to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:57.59,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.34,KM,Genkou,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you eating at your own leisure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:09.22,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:15.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:19.56,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, are you worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:22.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Um, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing at all! That’s the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.07,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,There {\i1}is{\i0} something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:33.02,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay. I know something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:33.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:37.33,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,When you find it, you’ll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:44.36,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, Marina, we’re going to play hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:50.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:54.20,KM,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:57.03,KM,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:59.60,KM,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:03.06,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:09.76,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,While Kobato-chan is counting to 10, everyone hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:11.39,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look for us, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:19.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I’m going to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:50.48,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is all I got for a souvenir? Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:53.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stack them as high as you want, I can carry anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:56.96,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This form is such a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:59.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s also quite pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:05.04,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t want to hear that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:13.13,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been a while, hasn’t it, Ginsei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:19.22,KM,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,That really is a shameful form.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:20.64,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:52.59,KM,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,The appearance may have changed, but inside you’re still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.95,KM,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Aren’t you coming back to the spirit world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.98,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There are things I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:03.47,KM,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,That little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.71,0:13:07.89,KM,Iorygoi,0000,0000,0000,,If you put a hand on Kobato, I’ll strangle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.39,KM,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t forget…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.64,KM,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,We {\i1}will{\i0} settle this once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.06,0:13:29.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:37.34,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where is everyone hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:50.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:02.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:05.59,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan looks like she’s having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:09.87,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan still hasn’t found anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:13.15,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,She’s starting to look in another strange place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:16.45,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like this is going to take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:20.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone’s so good at hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:21.37,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.40,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We’re going home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:28.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We can’t! Right now, I’m it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:29.56,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:32.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“It” has to find the people who are hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.73,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But it’s time…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.61,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kids, we’re leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:42.15,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:51.00,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:55.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun and Yoshio-kun, I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.94,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,She did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.76,KM,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,We were found!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:07.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru-kun, Yukari-chan, I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Masao-kun too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And you’re over there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:23.34,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, you have a leaf stuck in your hair again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:25.50,KM,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,You’re so clumsy. Get it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:28.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.42,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.66,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:35.07,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Lastly, let’s take a keepsake picture together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:40.02,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Where’s Marina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.57,0:15:45.18,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,She’s not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.87,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.28,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:54.35,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, please stay here with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:57.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go look too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:01.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:03.26,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.74,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.17,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.12,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.58,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:15.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:17.89,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:18.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:21.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she’s hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.55,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that’s the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:27.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If only I could have found them faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:35.69,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s try looking over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:39.82,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:41.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.64,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:08.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:19.59,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She’s sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:27.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.51,0:17:33.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:36.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:41.06,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, when I couldn’t find any…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.76,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,No, the four-leaf clover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:52.41,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,If you find it, you’ll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:55.18,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I’d give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:03.33,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you were so sad today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.53,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I looked everywhere but there weren’t any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:13.61,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:23.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay that you didn’t find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:27.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:33.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It cheers me up that you tried to find me some happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:39.00,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,That’s great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.61,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,This is a nice place, so let’s take the picture here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:55.27,KM,Fuijmoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:57.64,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:59.70,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s fine, just look forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.48,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:15.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The four-leaf clover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:28.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:31.94,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.37,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:42.16,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:48.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There’re lots and lots. It looks like we found happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:50.92,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, we’re taking another picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:09.62,KM,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,The baumkuchen is all tattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.29,KM,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,And it was from Genko-sama too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:16.88,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just one thing after another! What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:26.59,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You work for that old bear back there. That would make you…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:28.42,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.76,0:20:32.79,KM,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt! It’s Zuishou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.78,KM,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,I have a message from Genko-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:37.02,KM,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,He’s done looking into your request!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:38.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.91,KM,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,So, you can laugh nihilistically, looking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.52,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What? You damn bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.03,0:20:54.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:55.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:01.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san isn’t back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.04,0:21:09.49,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san is small, so what if he’s stuck somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:11.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,or fell in a hole in the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:14.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,or someone sat on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:18.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, this is terrible. He’s in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.89,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who’s in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:22.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:24.29,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:26.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:29.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:33.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.98,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:38.39,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So? How was the field trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:43.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:48.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a Happiness Clover, but it’s wilted a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:51.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so you can find happiness too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.46,0:22:01.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want everyone at Yomogi\NPreschool to always be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:10.09,KP,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,I’m to inform you that the previous head of Yomogi Preschool,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.09,0:22:13.44,KP,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,appears to have been tricked into taking out a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.73,KP,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The previous head?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:21.63,KP,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Okiura Sayaka’s father, but he died two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:32.81,KP,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,The trickster is a pretty dangerous fellow, and it involves a close relative of Okiura Sayaka. {Keeper: re-TLC?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:36.14,KP,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Now that’s a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:44.30,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, sooner or later, Yomogi Preschool will be crushed.
